# Schema
- Every table includes userId or is traceable to a user via join
- Binary files never live in Convex. Only storageId references
- Job states: queued/validating/processing/finalizing/completed/failed/cancelled/expired

# Query/Mutation safety
- Every query obtains userId via ctx.auth.getUserIdentity() and filters on it
- Admin operations use role checks and are never exposed to normal users
- No external API calls inside mutations. Use scheduled functions
